e":"message","user":"UPZHKAM7W","text":"```\nText object commands changed                            *text-objects-changed*\n----------------------------\n \nText object commands have new names.  This allows more text objects and makes\ncharacters available for other Visual mode commands.  Since no more single\ncharacters were available, text objects names now require two characters.\nThe first one is always 'i' or 'a'.\n        OLD     NEW      \n        a       aw      a word                  |v_aw|\n        A       aW      a WORD                  |v_aW|\n        s       as      a sentence              |v_as|\n        p       ap      a paragraph             |v_ap|\n        S       ab      a () block              |v_ab|\n        P       aB      a {} block              |v_aB|\n \nThere is another set of text objects that starts with \"i\", for \"inner\".  These\nselect the same objects, but exclude white space.\n```","ts":"1635762263.287800","bot_id":"BPM858KEE","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":null},{"client_msg_id":"397f4e33-b4dd-4ee7-b199-5806671717c8","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":":h text-objects-changed 今の原型ができたこの変更が入ったのが version 5","ts":"1635762263.287700","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"rTmM+"}]},{"client_msg_id":"7AE4B3BA-0E6E-4D21-BAB4-F048E83EED98","type":"message","user":"U782D5DF1","text":"スパルタンVimに書いてあった気はする","ts":"1635762233.287000","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"wrSt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"712fd5cb-c173-429e-b37e-00598285ed03","type":"message","user":"U9S4G0LJW","text":"さすが","ts":"1635762203.286200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"iom"}]},{"client_msg_id":"0a5db1ae-42f0-4f60-b75b-754df36e1077","type":"message","user":"U03C71D7H","text":"クォート(`\"` とか)のテキストオブジェクトは 7 